From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msado15: in-memory recordset position, Find, Sort, GetRows, GetString (2043)

msado15: an in-memory ADODB.Recordset gets AbsolutePosition (get/put),
Move, Find (field op value with =, <>, <, >, <=, >=, LIKE; skip and
direction), Sort, GetRows, GetString, Delete (current or all), LockType,
PageSize, PageCount, AbsolutePage, Source, Status and Update with a field
and value. Two bugs fixed on the way: a recordset with several columns
cleared the wrong memory when it grew, and a value assigned from a script
variable (passed by reference) was stored as the reference. An optional
string a script leaves out of GetString arrives as DISP_E_PARAMNOTFOUND
and is taken as absent.
